OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies after two men stabbed in
OL,4,Awaterfront area
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who was stabbed in a Kent town
OL,7,Fovernight has died from his injuries,
OL,8,Fwith police confirming a murder
OL,9,Finvestigation has begun.
OL,11,FKent Police said officers were called
OL,12,Fto the Ramsgate Harbour area at about
OL,13,F04:45 BST to reports of a man with a
OL,14,Fknife. Two men had been stabbed, one in
OL,15,FHarbour Street and one in Harbour
OL,16,FParade.
OL,18,FBoth were taken to hospital, where the
OL,19,F52-year-old man found in Harbour Street
OL,20,Flater died, the force said.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
